OL,3,GNEWSAElectrical fire on train causes   
OL,4,Arail disruption                        
OL,6,FAn electrical fire on a train resulted 
OL,7,Fin delays and cancellations on the rail
OL,8,Fnetwork between Penzance and Plymouth. 
OL,10,FNational Rail said the train had been  
OL,11,Fhalted between Liskeard and Par,       
OL,12,Faffecting morning services.            
OL,14,FIn an update at 12:39 GMT, it said the 
OL,15,Fincident had been cleared.             
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
