OL,3,GNEWSAElectrical fire on train causes   
OL,4,Arail disruption                        
OL,6,FA GWR spokesperson said fire services  
OL,7,Fresponded to a small electrical fire on
OL,8,Fthe Night Riviera Sleeper service on   
OL,9,FFriday morning. "The incident was      
OL,10,Fquickly dealt with, and customers were 
OL,11,Fmoved to another part of the train as a
OL,12,Fprecaution to avoid smoke," it said.   
